Package: swedishairquality
Type: Package
Title: Air Quality (PM10) Data for Major Swedish Cities
Version: 2.1.0
Date: 2026-10-06
Authors@R: c(
    person("Raja Uzair", "Saeed", email = "rajsa233@student.liu.se", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Daniel", "Persson", email = "danpe586@student.liu.se", role = "aut"))
Description: PM10 particulate matter data for six Swedish cities (Linkoping,
    Stockholm, Malmo, Gothenburg, Lulea and Umea), visualised in a Shiny web
    application. Ships a simulated sample dataset that works offline and can
    download live data from a 52North timeseries REST API such as the one
    SMHI used to host.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
